European field guide data: RivFISH v1.1 by Daniel Mameri and colleagues
(https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14509748), and European Red Lists of species,
European Environment Agency and contributors. These datasets are used under
CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The packaged data
select, normalize and combine their fields. Natural Earth boundaries are
public domain. Wikimedia Wikidata labels and the selected GBIF/iNaturalist
occurrence records are CC0. See docs/europe-field-guide.md for source links,
release identifiers, transformations, additional sources and coverage.

Czech fishery names, identifiers and locations are sourced from the Czech Fishing Union
(https://www.rybsvaz.cz/seznam-reviru) and the Moravian Fishing Union
(https://mrsbrno.cz/reviry). The offline atlas generalizes ČRS map outlines
and associates MRS locations with their individual directory records.
